    fzzr UI library  |  Matcha LuaVM  |  Drawing API only
    ---------------------------------------------------------------------
    Load it from your script:

        loadstring(httpget("https://raw.githubusercontent.com/<you>/<repo>/main/fzzr.lua"))()
        local Fzzr = _G.Fzzr                      -- Matcha drops loadstring return values, so it is exported here

    Then:  Fzzr:CreateWindow({...})  ->  Window:AddPage  ->  page:AddBox  ->  box:AddSwitch / AddSlider / ...  ->  Window:Init()
    Full documentation and an example script: see README.md and example.lua in the repository.

    Naming: nothing here reuses Matcha's own menu API names (UI, AddTab, Section, Toggle, Keybind,
    SliderInt, SliderFloat, Combo, Button, ColorPicker, InputText, Text, Tip, Spacing).

    Design: immediate-mode drawing on a pooled set of Drawing objects. Every drawing is created once, cached,
    and only touched when a property changes. Everything not drawn in a frame is hidden by a sweep at frame end.
    The "Common" tab (Settings: Configs / Display / Notifications, and Players) is built in and always last.
]]
